# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# BMAD Method - Local Working Artifacts
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# These folders contain generated/working artifacts. Track the framework
# source in _bmad/ but keep generated outputs out of version control by
# default. Commit specific artifacts deliberately with `git add -f`.

# Generated planning/UX/spec outputs are typically regenerated
# Uncomment to ignore all generated outputs:
# _bmad-output/
# _bmad-output/brainstorming/
# _bmad-output/planning-artifacts/
# _bmad-output/implementation-artifacts/
# _bmad-output/test-artifacts/
# _bmad-output/specs/

# Generated/derived brainstorming working files (often local-only)
_bmad-output/brainstorming/sessions/
_bmad-output/brainstorming/notes-*.md

